# Regression suite completeness

- Every new runnable ERP API or UI TestNG test class must be added to
  `src/test/resources/suites/regression.xml` in the same change.
- Adding a class to a domain suite such as `relocations.xml`, `inventory.xml`, or
  `ui.xml` does not replace registration in `regression.xml`.
- When adding methods to an existing class, verify that the class is already present in
  `regression.xml`.
- Keep the class in the matching domain section and preserve intentional execution order.
- Before finishing test changes, compare runnable test classes with `regression.xml` and
  run the `framework` suite; `RegressionSuiteCompletenessTest` must report no missing class.
- Framework-only, diagnostic, intentionally parked, or quarantined tests may stay outside
  regression only when the exclusion is documented next to the suite and explicitly noted
  in the change summary.
